[00:08.00]भाग ३: मच्छरी का उत्तर Bhāg 3: Machcharī kā Uttar (The Mosquito's Reply)
[00:10.78]तू अपने बलकान खातिर🎧 🎤 FULL LYRICS + PERFORMANCE SCRIPT
[00:13.56]🎶 Tanpura + river
[00:16.34]सुनो ओ धरती के लोगो…
[00:19.12]आज ना शास्त्र, ना कथा…
[00:21.90]आज होगा सामना —
[00:24.68]अहम् और वयं का…
[00:27.46]भूख और ध्यान का…
[00:30.24]🔥 Dholak hit
[00:33.02]🪕 [Ragni Alaap – Female | 0:40]
[00:35.80]ओ पंडित बैठा घणा घमंड में,
[00:38.57]मंत्र जपे अर ध्यान में…
[00:41.35]दीमी दीमी हम्म्म्म्म…
[00:44.13]नदी बोले, पवन बोले…
[00:46.91]कुछ और ही ग्यान में…
[00:49.69]Yo yo pandit, baitha tha gyaan mein
[00:52.47]aham brahmasmi, lost in dhyaan mein
[00:55.25]dwait advait sab bolता जा
[00:58.03]पर एक मच्छर ने scene बदल दिया
[01:00.81]मैं ब्रह्म हूँ” बोल्या जोर से
[01:03.59]पर हाथ हिलाया डर के शोर से
[01:06.37]किताबां में tha, par life se door
[01:09.15]एक chhoti si bite ne कर दिया cure
[01:11.93]🦟 Buzz moves around
[01:14.71]तू अपने बालक खातिर,
[01:17.49]एक बूंद चूस आवे से…
[01:20.27]मैं ना तेरे ध्यान तोड़ूं,
[01:23.05]मैं भूख बुझावन आवे से…
[01:25.83]तू कहे अद्वैत बड़ा भारी,
[01:28.61]पर मुझसे क्यूँ घबरावे से?
[01:31.39]तेरा “हम” में मैं ना सूं,
[01:34.17]फिर क्यूँ वयं गावे से?
[01:36.94]हाय रे मच्छरी, तेरी याद आवे से
[01:39.72]एक बूंद लेके भी, ज्ञान जगा जावे से
[01:42.50]हाय रे मच्छरी, तू छोटी ना से
[01:45.28]तेरी गूंज में पूरा ब्रह्म समावे से 🔥
[01:48.06]You say “we are one”, par karte alag
[01:50.84]tera advait sirf shabd ka jug
[01:53.62]karuna bina sab zero hai bhai
[01:56.40]andar ka sach अब समझ तू भाई
[01:59.18]jo tujhe kaate, wahi tera guru
[02:01.96]jo tujhe sataye, wahi tera suroor
[02:04.74]blood tera tera na, sabka flow
[02:07.52]mitti, paani, ped… aur machchar ka bhi right bro
[02:10.30]🎶 Beat drops, only tanpura + flute
[02:13.08]अब न हाथ हिलावे से…
[02:15.86]अब न मन चिढ़ावे से…
[02:18.64]जो आवे सो आवे से…
[02:21.42]जो जावे सो जावे से…
[02:24.20]👉 Pandit moves to right side (Advait zone)
[02:26.98]💥 [DROP – Chant Explosion | 5:10]
[02:29.76]🔥 Lights flash
[02:32.54]PHKD! PHKD! जीवन का code!
[02:35.31]दिल में डाल, system reload!
[02:38.09]Machchar भी तू! Pandit भी तू!
[02:40.87]Boond भी तू! Brahm भी तू! 🔥
[02:43.65]तेरा रक्त मेरा रक्त
[02:46.43]तेरा बच्चा मेरा बच्चा
[02:49.21]तेरी भूख मेरी भूख
[02:51.99]तेरा जीवन मेरा जीवन
[02:54.77]ना तू अलग… ना मैं अलग…
[02:57.55]बस एक ही धड़कन का संग…
[03:00.33]🎶 All instruments fade → only hum
[03:03.11]दीमी दीमी हम्म्म्म्म…
[03:05.89]ना मच्छर… ना पंडित रे
[03:08.67]बस एक जीवन धड़कत रे…
[03:11.45]हम्म्म्म्म्म…
[03:14.23]जो एक बूँद चूस आवे से..
[03:17.01]Tū apne balkān khātir
[03:19.79]jo ek bū̃d cūs āve se..
[03:22.57]For the sake of your children
[03:25.35]that one drop I come to sip..
[03:28.13]I do not come to disturb your meditation.
[03:30.91]I do not come to test your advaita.
[03:33.68]I come because my young are hungry.
[03:36.46]I come because a river of blood
[03:39.24]is to me what the Ganga is to you—
[03:42.02]sacred, sustaining, simple.
[03:44.80]You see a mosquito.
[03:47.58]I see motherhood.
[03:50.36]You see an itch.
[03:53.14]I see survival.
[03:55.92]इसके के आग लगे से
[03:58.70]जो तन्हें दूर भगावे से..
[04:01.48]Iske ke āg lage se
[04:04.26]jo tanheṅ dūr bhagāve se..
[04:07.04]May fire consume the one
[04:09.82]who drives me away..
[04:12.60]Not a curse—
[04:15.38]a cry.
[04:18.16]When you wave your hand,
[04:20.94]you are not protecting your jñāna.
[04:23.72]You are telling a mother:
[04:26.50]Your hunger does not belong here.
[04:29.28]Your body does not belong here.
[04:32.05]Your life is a disturbance to my peace.
[04:34.83]What kind of peace
[04:37.61]is built on pushing away
[04:40.39]the small, the hungry, the other?
[04:43.17]You chant vayam sādhanā asti—
[04:45.95]We are the practice.
[04:48.73]But your we did not include me.
[04:51.51]Your sādhanā did not include
[04:54.29]the weight of my belly,
[04:57.07]the urgency of my young,
[04:59.85]the ancient rhythm of this proboscis
[05:02.63]seeking what it needs to create life.
[05:05.41]You wanted advaita—
[05:08.19]the unbroken, the still, the grand.
[05:10.97]But advaita without karuṇā (compassion)
[05:13.75]is just another name for numbness.
[05:16.53]Let me teach you now,
[05:19.31]as I taught you then:
[05:22.09]Your blood is not yours alone.
[05:24.87]It belongs to the soil, the rain, the mango tree,
[05:27.65]and to me—
[05:30.42]to my children yet to be born.
[05:33.20]When I land on your arm,
[05:35.98]I am not breaking your meditation.
[05:38.76]I am completing it.
[05:41.54]Because meditation that excludes life
[05:44.32]is not meditation.
[05:47.10]It is escape.
[05:49.88]You asked for a mantra.
[05:52.66]I give it now:
[05:55.44]Let the one who is hungry
[05:58.22]be fed by you.
[06:01.00]Let the one who is small
[06:03.78]be seen by you.
[06:06.56]Let the one who annoys you
[06:09.34]be your guru.
[06:12.12]This is vayam.
[06:14.90]This is sādhanā.
[06:17.68]This is the only anthem.
[06:20.46]I do not need your praise.
[06:23.24]I do not need your gratitude.
[06:26.02]I only need your stillness
[06:28.79]when I come.
[06:31.57]If you can give that—
[06:34.35]if you can sit with open arm
[06:37.13]and let me take what I need—
[06:39.91]then you will know:
[06:42.69]तू ही मच्छरी है
[06:45.47]तू ही पंडित है
[06:48.25]तू ही बूँद है
[06:51.03]तू ही ब्रह्म है
[06:53.81]Tū hī machcharī hai
[06:56.59]tū hī paṇḍit hai
[06:59.37]tū hī bū̃d hai
[07:02.15]tū hī brahma hai
[07:04.93]You are the mosquito
[07:07.71]You are the scholar
[07:10.49]You are the drop
[07:13.27]You are Brahman
[07:16.05]दीमी दीमी हम्मmmmmm
[07:18.83]Dhīmī dhīmī hmmmmm
[07:21.61]Softly, softly… hmmmmm
[07:24.39]Not a threat.
[07:27.16]Not a curse.
[07:29.94]Just the sound of life
[07:32.72]continuing.
[07:35.50]If you hear it as mantra,
[07:38.28]you are free.
[07:41.06]If you hear it as disturbance,
[07:43.84]you are still a pandit
[07:46.62]who has not yet understood.
[07:49.40]भाग ४: आगे बढ़ायें Bhāg 4: Aage Badhāyen (Moving Forward)
[07:52.18][A mosquito lands—perhaps the same one, perhaps her daughter, perhaps just the memory of her. He does not open his eyes.
